    <docsUrl>https://github.com/objectyan/CyberSlacker/blob/master/README.md</docsUrl>
    <tags>slacker moyu work countdown timer widget desktop-widget productivity holiday payday dotnet</tags>
    <summary>A professional desktop widget for work-life balance and countdowns.</summary>
    <description>
      [English]
      CyberSlacker is a modern desktop widget built with WPF (.NET 8). It is designed to help
      office workers keep track of their "freedom" with high precision.

      Key Features:
      - Smart Holiday Integration: Automatically syncs with holiday APIs to handle legal holidays
      and makeup workdays.
      - Precision Countdown: Intelligent countdown logic that accounts for lunch breaks and
      periodic rest times.
      - Immortal Desktop Widget: Uses low-level Win32 hooks to stay pinned to the desktop, even
      when pressing Win+D.
      - Salary Day Strategy: Customizable payday tracking with weekend adjustment strategies (pay
      ahead or delay).
      - Modern Interaction: Support for Windows 10/11 native color Toast notifications and
      randomized "slacker" quotes.

      [中文]
      赛博摸鱼员 (CyberSlacker) 是一款基于 WPF (.NET 8) 开发的现代化桌面小组件。它不仅是一个高精度的倒计时器，更是一个贴心的工位助手。

      核心特性：
      - 智联节假日：集成 API 自动同步法定假、调休及补班，计算绝无误差。
      - 净工时倒计时：自动感知午休、小憩时段，显示真正的剩余“搬砖”秒数。
      - 桌面不死挂件：采用底层 Win32 注入，按下 Win+D 显示桌面时依然稳如泰山。
      - 智能发薪日：支持自定义发薪策略（遇周末提前或延后），钱到手前一秒都知道。
      - 现代感交互：支持 Win10/11 原生彩色 Toast 通知及动态随机毒鸡汤。
    </description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/objectyan/CyberSlacker/releases</releaseNotes>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency id="dotnet-8.0-desktopruntime" version="[8.0.0, 9.0.0)" />
    </dependencies>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>